---
interface Props { view: 'overview' | 'signals' | 'summary'; }
const { view } = Astro.props;
---

<section class:list={['dashboard-detail-screen', `dashboard-view-${view}`]} aria-label="Productivity dashboard">
  {view === 'overview' && <><header><div><small>WORKFORCE OVERVIEW</small><b>Member ranking</b><p>Top contributors this week</p></div><button type="button">All departments</button></header><div class="dashboard-ranking-head"><span>Rank</span><span>Member</span><span>Department</span><span>Score</span></div><div class="dashboard-member-list">{[['1','OB','Olivia Bennett','Product design','97'],['2','EW','Ethan Walker','Engineering','94'],['3','MT','Maya Thompson','Customer success','91'],['4','JR','James Rivera','Marketing','89'],['5','SK','Sophia Kim','Operations','87'],['6','AL','Avery Lewis','Sales','84']].map(([rank,initials,name,department,score]) => <article><span>{rank}</span><strong><i>{initials}</i>{name}</strong><span>{department}</span><b>{score}</b></article>)}</div><footer class="dashboard-ranking-footer"><span>Showing 1 to 6 of 148 members</span><div><button type="button">‹</button><button type="button">›</button></div></footer></>}
  {view === 'signals' && <><header><div><small>PROJECT ACTIVITY</small><b>Project usage ranking</b><p>Based on tracked work activity</p></div><label><span>⌕</span> Search projects</label></header><div class="dashboard-project-list">{[['Northern Lights Portal','92%'],['Lakeview Health Launch','86%'],['Cedar Commerce Refresh','81%'],['Atlas Mobile Launch','76%'],['Client Onboarding Hub','69%'],['Brand Experience Update','63%']].map(([name,usage]) => <article><strong>{name}</strong><span><i><b style={`--usage:${usage}`}></b></i><em>{usage}</em></span></article>)}</div><footer class="dashboard-ranking-footer"><span>6 active projects shown</span><div><button type="button">‹</button><button type="button">›</button></div></footer></>}
  {view === 'summary' && <><header><div><small>WORK SUMMARY</small><b>This week's narrative</b></div><span>AI-assisted</span></header><div class="dashboard-summary"><span>✦</span><div><b>Progress is strongest across launch preparation.</b><p>Teams completed core design reviews, moved the authentication work forward, and began client handoff preparation.</p></div></div><div class="dashboard-summary-list"><p><span>Projects</span><b>Northstar platform and Q3 launch received the most focused effort.</b></p><p><span>Workload</span><b>Delivery work increased while planned work stayed balanced.</b></p></div></>}
  {view === 'summary' && <div class="dashboard-summary-extra"><span>Next step</span><b>Review the client handoff timeline and confirm ownership for the remaining launch tasks.</b></div>}
</section>
